# Libraries & CDN

## All pages (unified stack)

Load in `<head>`:

1. **UIkit CSS** — `uikit@3.25.16` (jsDelivr)
2. **custom.css** — local shared stylesheet

Load before `</body>` with `defer`:

1. **UIkit JS** — `uikit.min.js` + `uikit-icons.min.js`

```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/uikit@3.25.16/dist/css/uikit.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="custom.css">

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/uikit@3.25.16/dist/js/uikit.min.js" defer></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/uikit@3.25.16/dist/js/uikit-icons.min.js" defer></script>
```

jQuery has been removed. Bootstrap is no longer used on active pages. Use UIkit data attributes (`uk-*`) and vanilla JS for interactivity.

## Favicon

Use local `favicon.ico` in repo root:

```html
<link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" sizes="any">
```

## Images

WebP variants (`rohit-*.webp`) committed in repo; `<picture>` provides JPG fallback in markup:

```html
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="rohit-developer.webp" type="image/webp">

<picture>
  <source srcset="rohit-developer.webp" type="image/webp">
  <img src="rohit-developer.jpg" alt="..." width="400" height="400" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
</picture>
```

## Upgrade Guidelines

- Bump UIkit on all HTML pages together; test offcanvas, grid, cards
- Pin CDN URLs with explicit versions; avoid `@latest`
- Keep scripts deferred at end of `<body>` for FCP/LCP
- Prefer jsDelivr over cdnjs for UIkit (current standard)
